# Question-to-Answer Release Acceptance

Status: NOT_STARTED
Milestone: A6 Exact-candidate answer handoff
Dependencies: 14_PACKAGING_RELEASE.todo, 13_COMPATIBILITY_QUALIFICATION.todo, 33_ANSWER_LATENCY_QUALITY.todo, 34_ANSWER_PRIVACY_RESILIENCE.todo

## Purpose

Deliver the actual qualified dictate/select/Ask/answer workflow, not merely a model API wrapper.

## Tasks

- [ ] Run the complete synthetic Service Fabric ELI5 journey on the exact packaged candidate.
- [ ] Verify local-only capture, visible question snapshot, explicitly selected provider destination and streamed result.
- [ ] Confirm accepted latency/fidelity/answer-quality budgets and current model lifecycle.
- [ ] Qualify answer-pane streaming/cancel/resize/theme/focus with the required sharing matrix.
- [ ] Complete owner usability/accessibility, data-policy, license/signing and distribution approvals.
- [ ] Update usage/support/cost/troubleshooting guidance and immutable artifact/measurement receipts.
- [ ] Hand off only through an authorized destination; no publication inferred from a working API.

## Acceptance criteria

- [ ] The owner's intended question, not unrelated meeting text, produces the corresponding useful answer.
- [ ] Runtime/support/privacy claims match the exact measured configuration.
- [ ] No unfinished mandatory work is hidden behind DONE or replaced by an optional cloud-ASR/broker success.
- [ ] Docker remains optional final-stage packaging after the native application is accepted.

## Completion evidence

- Final release acceptance remains unexecuted. Installed-provider code and local preview39 exist;
  one synthetic Agency model request is not user, recorder or performance qualification.

